# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Life Simulator — Environment Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SETUP:
#   1. Copy this file to  config/.env
#   2. Replace the placeholder values with your real credentials
#   3. config/.env is git-ignored and will NOT be committed
#
# Get a free Groq API key at: https://console.groq.com
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

AI_API_KEY=YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY_HERE
AI_PROVIDER=groq
AI_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ── Security note (exported builds) ──────────────────────────────
# config/.env is bundled into the exported .pck archive and can be
# extracted from a shipped .exe. This is acceptable for editor-run
# demos and classroom presentations.
# For public distribution, switch to a runtime user:// config file.
# Document this trade-off explicitly in the final project writeup.
